sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Staff
    participant W as Web Client
    participant R as REST Routers + Auth
    participant P as Reporting & Export
    participant A as Audit Logger
    participant D as Database

    S->>W: Filter reach report (school = Medicine, 2025–26)
    W->>R: GET /reports/reach?school=...&year=...
    R->>R: Check login
    R->>P: Build report
    P->>D: COUNT(DISTINCT participant) by school
    D-->>P: Unique and repeat counts
    P-->>W: Table + chart shown on the page (no student ID column)
    S->>W: Download CSV
    W->>R: GET /exports/reach.csv
    R->>A: Log export
    A->>D: Save audit entry
    R-->>W: CSV file (no student ID column)
